    "text": "int answer = 0;\n\nint factorial(int n) {\n    if (n <= 1) {\n        return 1;\n    }\n    return n * factorial(n - 1);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    answer = factorial(5);\n    return answer == 120 ? 0 : 1;\n}\n"
